 "recipe_description": "the study's R recipe (span return): the copy-pointer carrier network (61,613 parameters) trained from scratch per population on a pooled training set (windows whose labels end before the population's validation set), early stopping on the population's last 93 days before the training cut (at most 30 epochs, patience 5); then the 93-day validation span returned to the training set at the population's own sampling density (labels ending within 24 h of the cut not returned) and training continued from the selected weights with a fresh AdamW for exactly 8 epochs, final weights kept; seeds 0, 1 and 2 averaged, anchored by the unchanged ANKYRA 2.2.1 anchoring layer, weekly seasonal naive on off-state and micro-load windows",
 "note": "Paths are relative to the research root (environment variable ANKYRA_LITE_RESEARCH_ROOT, default <repo>/../HKAD_V3). 'npz' is the anchored product of the three-seed ensemble (arrays building, origin, traj (n, 744), level, peak, off, micro; origins on the store named by 'store'); 'seed_npz' the anchored products of each seed's carrier alone (same layout, same anchoring step); 'run_dirs' the three seeds' span-return runs (carrier.npz: the carrier forecasts at the origin and the six pseudo-origins and the training cut; COMPLETE.json: the per-epoch record; the weights file named by 'checkpoint'); 'start_run_dirs' the from-scratch stage the span return continued (TRAINED.json / COMPLETE.json: validation criterion per epoch, best epoch; best.pt); 'span_plan' the returned validation span; 'prep' the anchoring layer's temp_sigma_std ('sigma') and the split record; 'recipe_variants' the anchored three-seed products of the study's other recipe arms on the same windows (P3s: from-scratch stage alone, F: 8 continuation epochs without the span return, V: proportional validation set with early stopping). 'store': 'original' = the population's store as first built; 'corrected' = trained with the corrected CINELDI store (CINELDI's first hour labelled 59 days too early in the original store): for CINELDI its own data (CINELDI origins = original origins + 1,416 h), for Drammen the CINELDI windows of its pooled training set.",
